# Copy this file to ".env" and paste your key in.
# Get one free (no card) at https://console.groq.com  ->  API Keys
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional, and best left commented out. Neha asks Groq which models your key
# can use and picks one, so a retired model can never mute her again. Pinning an
# id here overrides that — which is how "the model does not exist" happened.
# VITE_GROQ_MODEL=
